{"schema_version":"talkami_spoken_audio_manifest_v2","theme_id":"09.03","status":"audio_not_recorded","main_count":82,"reply_count":10,"alternative_count":3,"total_audio_count":95,"audio_naming":"${id}.mp3","entries":[{"id":"09.03.01-S001","kind":"main","cn":"先做这个吗？","meaning_my":"ဒါကို အရင်လုပ်ရမှာလား။","audio_file":"09.03.01-S001.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"09.03.01-S001_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"对，先做这个。","meaning_my":"ဟုတ်တယ်၊ ဒါကို အရင်လုပ်ပါ။","audio_file":"09.03.01-S001_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"09.03.01-S002","kind":"main","cn":"好，我马上做。","meaning_my":"ကောင်းပြီ၊ အခုပဲ လုပ်မယ်။","audio_file":"09.03.01-S002.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"09.03.01-S002_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"好的，我现在就做。","meaning_my":"ကောင်းပြီ၊ အခုပဲ လုပ်မယ်။","audio_file":"09.03.01-S002_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"09.03.01-S003","kind":"main","cn":"做完交给谁？","meaning_my":"လုပ်ပြီးရင် ဘယ်သူ့ကို အပ်ရမလဲ။","audio_file":"09.03.01-S003.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"09.03.01-S003_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"交给组长。","meaning_my":"အဖွဲ့ခေါင်းဆောင်ကို အပ်ပါ။","audio_file":"09.03.01-S003_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"09.03.01-S004","kind":"main","cn":"有先后顺序吗？","meaning_my":"အရင်နောက် အစီအစဉ် ရှိလား။","audio_file":"09.03.01-S004.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"09.03.01-S005","kind":"main","cn":"今天要做完吗？","meaning_my":"ဒီနေ့ အပြီးလုပ်ရမှာလား။","audio_file":"09.03.01-S005.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"09.03.01-S006","kind":"main","cn":"还有别的要求吗？","meaning_my":"တခြား ဘာလိုအပ်ချက်တွေ ရှိသေးလဲ။","audio_file":"09.03.01-S006.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"09.03.01-S007","kind":"main","cn":"材料不够了怎么办？","meaning_my":"ကုန်ကြမ်း မလောက်တော့ရင် ဘယ်လိုလုပ်ရမလဲ။","audio_file":"09.03.01-S007.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"09.03.01-S007_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"先告诉组长。","meaning_my":"အဖွဲ့ခေါင်းဆောင်ကို အရင်ပြောပါ။","audio_file":"09.03.01-S007_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"09.03.01-S008","kind":"main","cn":"这批要做多少个？","meaning_my":"ဒီအသုတ်ကို ဘယ်နှခု လုပ်ရမလဲ။","audio_file":"09.03.01-S008.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"09.03.01-S009","kind":"main","cn":"这批最晚几点交？","meaning_my":"ဒီအသုတ်ကို နောက်ဆုံး ဘယ်နှနာရီ အပ်ရမလဲ။","audio_file":"09.03.01-S009.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"09.03.01-S010","kind":"main","cn":"这两种材料不能混放。","meaning_my":"ဒီကုန်ကြမ်းနှစ်မျိုးကို ရောမထားရဘူး။","audio_file":"09.03.01-S010.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"09.03.01-S011","kind":"main","cn":"标签贴在什么位置？","meaning_my":"တံဆိပ်ကို ဘယ်နေရာမှာ ကပ်ရမလဲ။","audio_file":"09.03.01-S011.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"09.03.01-S012","kind":"main","cn":"先把这箱搬到门口。","meaning_my":"ဒီပုံးကို တံခါးဝဆီ အရင်ရွှေ့ပါ။","audio_file":"09.03.01-S012.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"09.03.01-S013","kind":"main","cn":"做完这个再做那个。","meaning_my":"ဒါပြီးမှ ဟိုဟာကို လုပ်ပါ။","audio_file":"09.03.01-S013.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"09.03.01-S014","kind":"main","cn":"这个先别动。","meaning_my":"ဒါကို အခု မထိနဲ့ဦး။","audio_file":"09.03.01-S014.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"09.03.01-S015","kind":"main","cn":"先做最急的。","meaning_my":"အရေးအကြီးဆုံးအလုပ်ကို အရင်လုပ်ပါ။","audio_file":"09.03.01-S015.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"09.03.01-S016","kind":"main","cn":"做完给我看一下。","meaning_my":"လုပ်ပြီးရင် ကျွန်တော်/ကျွန်မကို ပြပါ။","audio_file":"09.03.01-S016.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"09.03.01-S017","kind":"main","cn":"有问题马上告诉我。","meaning_my":"ပြဿနာရှိရင် ချက်ချင်း ပြောပါ။","audio_file":"09.03.01-S017.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"09.03.01-S018","kind":"main","cn":"上班通知能发文字吗？","meaning_my":"အလုပ်အသိပေးချက်ကို စာနဲ့ ပို့ပေးလို့ရမလား။","audio_file":"09.03.01-S018.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"09.03.01-S019","kind":"main","cn":"这件事能明天再做吗？","meaning_my":"ဒီအလုပ်ကို မနက်ဖြန်မှ လုပ်လို့ရမလား။","audio_file":"09.03.01-S019.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"09.03.01-S020","kind":"main","cn":"我确认一下，是这批吗？","meaning_my":"အတည်ပြုချင်လို့ပါ၊ ဒီအသုတ်လား။","audio_file":"09.03.01-S020.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"09.03.01-S021","kind":"main","cn":"材料在哪儿拿？","meaning_my":"ကုန်ကြမ်း ဘယ်မှာယူရမလဲ။","audio_file":"09.03.01-S021.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"09.03.01-S022","kind":"main","cn":"做完放哪儿？","meaning_my":"လုပ်ပြီးရင် ဘယ်မှာထားရမလဲ။","audio_file":"09.03.01-S022.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"09.03.01-S023","kind":"main","cn":"做到什么标准算合格？","meaning_my":"ဘယ်လိုလုပ်မှ စံနှုန်းမီတယ်လို့ သတ်မှတ်လဲ။","audio_file":"09.03.01-S023.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"09.03.01-S024","kind":"main","cn":"有样品可以参考吗？","meaning_my":"နမူနာတစ်ခု ကြည့်လို့ရလား။","audio_file":"09.03.01-S024.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"09.03.01-S024_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"有，先看这个样品。","meaning_my":"ရှိတယ်၊ ဒီနမူနာကို အရင်ကြည့်ပါ။","audio_file":"09.03.01-S024_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"09.03.01-S025","kind":"main","cn":"做到一半有问题找谁？","meaning_my":"လုပ်နေရင်း ပြဿနာရှိရင် ဘယ်သူ့ကို မေးရမလဲ။","audio_file":"09.03.01-S025.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"09.03.01-S026","kind":"main","cn":"做完要签名吗？","meaning_my":"လုပ်ပြီးရင် လက်မှတ်ထိုးရမလား။","audio_file":"09.03.01-S026.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"09.03.02-S001","kind":"main","cn":"刚才那一步能再讲一遍吗？","meaning_my":"ခုနက အဆင့်ကို နောက်တစ်ခါ ပြန်ရှင်းပြပေးလို့ရမလား။","audio_file":"09.03.02-S001.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"09.03.02-S002","kind":"main","cn":"能示范一下吗？","meaning_my":"တစ်ခါလောက် လုပ်ပြပေးလို့ရမလား။","audio_file":"09.03.02-S002.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"09.03.02-S002_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"可以，我先做一遍。","meaning_my":"ရတယ်၊ တစ်ခါ အရင်လုပ်ပြမယ်။","audio_file":"09.03.02-S002_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"09.03.02-S002_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"能做给我看一遍吗？","meaning_my":"တစ်ခါလောက် လုပ်ပြပေးလို့ရမလား။","audio_file":"09.03.02-S002_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"09.03.02-S003","kind":"main","cn":"我这样做对吗？","meaning_my":"ဒီလိုလုပ်တာ မှန်လား။","audio_file":"09.03.02-S003.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"09.03.02-S003_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"这里还要调整一下。","meaning_my":"ဒီနေရာကို နည်းနည်း ထပ်ပြင်ရမယ်။","audio_file":"09.03.02-S003_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"09.03.02-S004","kind":"main","cn":"这一步做完呢？","meaning_my":"ဒီအဆင့်ပြီးရင် ဘာဆက်လုပ်ရမလဲ။","audio_file":"09.03.02-S004.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"09.03.02-S005","kind":"main","cn":"这一步我不会。","meaning_my":"ဒီအဆင့်ကို မလုပ်တတ်သေးဘူး။","audio_file":"09.03.02-S005.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"09.03.02-S005_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"先别动，我来教你。","meaning_my":"အခု မထိနဲ့ဦး၊ သင်ပေးမယ်။","audio_file":"09.03.02-S005_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"09.03.02-S006","kind":"main","cn":"这一步没听懂。","meaning_my":"ဒီအဆင့်ကို နားမလည်လိုက်ဘူး။","audio_file":"09.03.02-S006.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"09.03.02-S007","kind":"main","cn":"这个数字我没听清。","meaning_my":"ဒီနံပါတ်ကို သေချာ မကြားလိုက်ဘူး။","audio_file":"09.03.02-S007.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"09.03.02-S008","kind":"main","cn":"这两个零件有什么区别？","meaning_my":"ဒီအစိတ်အပိုင်းနှစ်ခု ဘာကွာလဲ။","audio_file":"09.03.02-S008.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"09.03.02-S009","kind":"main","cn":"我能先试做一个吗？","meaning_my":"တစ်ခုလောက် အရင် စမ်းလုပ်ကြည့်လို့ရမလား။","audio_file":"09.03.02-S009.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"09.03.02-S010","kind":"main","cn":"这个标志是什么意思？","meaning_my":"ဒီအမှတ်အသားက ဘာအဓိပ္ပာယ်လဲ။","audio_file":"09.03.02-S010.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"09.03.02-S011","kind":"main","cn":"这个零件要怎么装？","meaning_my":"ဒီအစိတ်အပိုင်းကို ဘယ်လိုတပ်ရမလဲ။","audio_file":"09.03.02-S011.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"09.03.02-S012","kind":"main","cn":"能在旁边看着我做吗？","meaning_my":"ဘေးကနေ ကျွန်တော်/ကျွန်မ လုပ်တာကို ကြည့်ပေးလို့ရမလား။","audio_file":"09.03.02-S012.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"09.03.02-S013","kind":"main","cn":"这里做错了，怎么改？","meaning_my":"ဒီနေရာမှာ မှားလုပ်မိပြီ၊ ဘယ်လိုပြင်ရမလဲ။","audio_file":"09.03.02-S013.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"09.03.02-S014","kind":"main","cn":"是往这边转吗？","meaning_my":"ဒီဘက်ကို လှည့်ရမှာလား။","audio_file":"09.03.02-S014.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"09.03.02-S015","kind":"main","cn":"这个要拧紧吗？","meaning_my":"ဒါကို တင်းတင်းကျပ်ကျပ် လှည့်တပ်ရမလား။","audio_file":"09.03.02-S015.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"09.03.02-S016","kind":"main","cn":"我再看一遍。","meaning_my":"နောက်တစ်ခါ ထပ်ကြည့်ပါဦးမယ်။","audio_file":"09.03.02-S016.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"09.03.02-S017","kind":"main","cn":"我记下来了。","meaning_my":"မှတ်ထားလိုက်ပြီ။","audio_file":"09.03.02-S017.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"09.03.02-S018","kind":"main","cn":"不确定就先停下。","meaning_my":"မသေချာရင် အရင်ရပ်ထားပါ။","audio_file":"09.03.02-S018.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"09.03.03-S001","kind":"main","cn":"这个我们一起做。","meaning_my":"ဒါကို အတူတူ လုပ်ကြမယ်။","audio_file":"09.03.03-S001.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"09.03.03-S002","kind":"main","cn":"这部分你做还是我做？","meaning_my":"ဒီအပိုင်းကို ခင်ဗျားလုပ်မလား၊ ကျွန်တော်/ကျွန်မ လုပ်မလား။","audio_file":"09.03.03-S002.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"09.03.03-S003","kind":"main","cn":"这部分能跟你换一下吗？","meaning_my":"ဒီအပိုင်းကို ခင်ဗျားနဲ့ လဲလုပ်လို့ရမလား။","audio_file":"09.03.03-S003.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"09.03.03-S004","kind":"main","cn":"等我两分钟。","meaning_my":"နှစ်မိနစ်လောက် စောင့်ပါဦး။","audio_file":"09.03.03-S004.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"09.03.03-S005","kind":"main","cn":"这部分我负责。","meaning_my":"ဒီအပိုင်းကို ကျွန်တော်/ကျွန်မ တာဝန်ယူမယ်။","audio_file":"09.03.03-S005.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"09.03.03-S006","kind":"main","cn":"材料不够，我去拿。","meaning_my":"ကုန်ကြမ်း မလောက်လို့ သွားယူဦးမယ်။","audio_file":"09.03.03-S006.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"09.03.03-S007","kind":"main","cn":"你忙不过来我帮你。","meaning_my":"တစ်ယောက်တည်း မနိုင်ရင် ကူပေးမယ်။","audio_file":"09.03.03-S007.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"09.03.03-S008","kind":"main","cn":"这箱太重了，帮我抬一下。","meaning_my":"ဒီပုံး လေးလွန်းလို့ ကူမပေးပါဦး။","audio_file":"09.03.03-S008.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"09.03.03-S008_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"好，我们一起抬。","meaning_my":"ကောင်းပြီ၊ အတူတူ မကြမယ်။","audio_file":"09.03.03-S008_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"09.03.03-S009","kind":"main","cn":"上一班有什么要交代的？","meaning_my":"ပြီးခဲ့တဲ့ဆိုင်းက ဘာတွေ လွှဲပြောစရာ ရှိလဲ။","audio_file":"09.03.03-S009.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"09.03.03-S010","kind":"main","cn":"我忙不过来。","meaning_my":"အလုပ်တွေ တစ်ယောက်တည်း မနိုင်တော့ဘူး။","audio_file":"09.03.03-S010.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"09.03.03-S011","kind":"main","cn":"做完跟我说一声。","meaning_my":"လုပ်ပြီးရင် ပြောပါဦး။","audio_file":"09.03.03-S011.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"09.03.03-S012","kind":"main","cn":"现在交接还是等会儿交接？","meaning_my":"အခု အလုပ်လွှဲမလား၊ ခဏနေမှ လွှဲမလား။","audio_file":"09.03.03-S012.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"09.03.03-S013","kind":"main","cn":"这个太重，两个人抬。","meaning_my":"ဒါ လေးလွန်းတယ်၊ နှစ်ယောက် ကူမကြမယ်။","audio_file":"09.03.03-S013.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"09.03.03-S014","kind":"main","cn":"工具用完放回原处。","meaning_my":"ကိရိယာကို သုံးပြီးရင် မူလနေရာမှာ ပြန်ထားပါ။","audio_file":"09.03.03-S014.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"09.03.03-S015","kind":"main","cn":"交接清楚再走。","meaning_my":"သေချာ လွှဲပြောင်းပြီးမှ ပြန်ပါ။","audio_file":"09.03.03-S015.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"09.03.03-S016","kind":"main","cn":"能帮我数一下这批货吗？","meaning_my":"ဒီကုန်ပစ္စည်းအသုတ်ကို ရေတွက်ပေးလို့ရမလား။","audio_file":"09.03.03-S016.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"09.03.03-S017","kind":"main","cn":"这一批我来数，你来装。","meaning_my":"ဒီအသုတ်ကို ကျွန်တော်/ကျွန်မ ရေတွက်မယ်၊ ခင်ဗျား ထုပ်ပိုးပါ။","audio_file":"09.03.03-S017.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"09.03.03-S018","kind":"main","cn":"这边我来，你弄那边。","meaning_my":"ဒီဘက်ကို ကျွန်တော်/ကျွန်မ လုပ်မယ်၊ ခင်ဗျား ဟိုဘက်ကို လုပ်ပါ။","audio_file":"09.03.03-S018.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"09.03.04-S001","kind":"main","cn":"我做完了。","meaning_my":"လုပ်ပြီးပါပြီ။","audio_file":"09.03.04-S001.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"09.03.04-S001_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"这个已经做好了。","meaning_my":"ဒီဟာ လုပ်ပြီးပြီ။","audio_file":"09.03.04-S001_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"09.03.04-S002","kind":"main","cn":"还差十个。","meaning_my":"နောက်ထပ် ဆယ်ခု လိုသေးတယ်။","audio_file":"09.03.04-S002.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"09.03.04-S003","kind":"main","cn":"这个我处理不了，能帮我看看吗？","meaning_my":"ဒါကို ကိုယ်တိုင် မဖြေရှင်းနိုင်လို့ ကြည့်ပေးလို့ရမလား။","audio_file":"09.03.04-S003.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"09.03.04-S004","kind":"main","cn":"我已经交上去了。","meaning_my":"အပ်ပြီးပါပြီ။","audio_file":"09.03.04-S004.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"09.03.04-S005","kind":"main","cn":"还要再检查吗？","meaning_my":"ထပ်စစ်ဖို့ လိုသေးလား။","audio_file":"09.03.04-S005.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"09.03.04-S006","kind":"main","cn":"只差最后一步了。","meaning_my":"နောက်ဆုံးအဆင့်ပဲ ကျန်တော့တယ်။","audio_file":"09.03.04-S006.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"09.03.04-S007","kind":"main","cn":"还有一项没确认。","meaning_my":"အတည်မပြုရသေးတဲ့အချက် တစ်ခု ရှိသေးတယ်။","audio_file":"09.03.04-S007.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"09.03.04-S008","kind":"main","cn":"数据跟单子对不上。","meaning_my":"အချက်အလက်နဲ့ စာရင်း မကိုက်ဘူး။","audio_file":"09.03.04-S008.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"09.03.04-S009","kind":"main","cn":"有三件不合格。","meaning_my":"စံနှုန်းမမီတဲ့ ပစ္စည်း သုံးခု ရှိတယ်။","audio_file":"09.03.04-S009.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"09.03.04-S010","kind":"main","cn":"机器突然停了。","meaning_my":"စက် ရုတ်တရက် ရပ်သွားတယ်။","audio_file":"09.03.04-S010.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"09.03.04-S010_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"先停下，通知维修人员。","meaning_my":"အရင်ရပ်ထားပြီး ပြင်ဆရာကို အကြောင်းကြားပါ။","audio_file":"09.03.04-S010_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"09.03.04-S011","kind":"main","cn":"有没有报警提示？","meaning_my":"စက်မှာ သတိပေးချက် ပေါ်လာလား။","audio_file":"09.03.04-S011.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"09.03.04-S012","kind":"main","cn":"先别乱动，我找维修员。","meaning_my":"အခု လျှောက်မထိနဲ့ဦး၊ ပြင်ဆရာကို ခေါ်မယ်။","audio_file":"09.03.04-S012.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"09.03.04-S013","kind":"main","cn":"这一箱少了两件。","meaning_my":"ဒီပုံးထဲ ပစ္စည်း နှစ်ခု လျော့နေတယ်။","audio_file":"09.03.04-S013.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"09.03.04-S014","kind":"main","cn":"今天可能做不完。","meaning_my":"ဒီနေ့ အပြီးမလုပ်နိုင်လောက်ဘူး။","audio_file":"09.03.04-S014.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"09.03.04-S015","kind":"main","cn":"做完了，接下来做什么？","meaning_my":"လုပ်ပြီးပြီ၊ နောက်ဘာ ဆက်လုပ်ရမလဲ။","audio_file":"09.03.04-S015.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"09.03.04-S015_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"先汇报完成数量。","meaning_my":"ပြီးသွားတဲ့အရေအတွက်ကို အရင် တင်ပြပါ။","audio_file":"09.03.04-S015_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"09.03.04-S016","kind":"main","cn":"这项数量填错了。","meaning_my":"ဒီအချက်မှာ အရေအတွက် မှားဖြည့်ထားတယ်။","audio_file":"09.03.04-S016.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"09.03.04-S017","kind":"main","cn":"有风险就先停。","meaning_my":"အန္တရာယ်ရှိရင် အရင် ရပ်ထားပါ။","audio_file":"09.03.04-S017.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"09.03.04-S018","kind":"main","cn":"已完成百分之八十。","meaning_my":"ရှစ်ဆယ်ရာခိုင်နှုန်း ပြီးပါပြီ။","audio_file":"09.03.04-S018.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"09.03.04-S019","kind":"main","cn":"材料不够，做不下去了。","meaning_my":"ကုန်ကြမ်း မလောက်လို့ ဆက်မလုပ်နိုင်တော့ဘူး။","audio_file":"09.03.04-S019.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"09.03.04-S020","kind":"main","cn":"问题解决了。","meaning_my":"ပြဿနာ ပြေလည်သွားပြီ။","audio_file":"09.03.04-S020.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"}]}
